Operator Description <code>==</code> Equal <code>!=</code> Not equal <code>&gt;</code> Greater than <code>&lt;</code> Less than <code>&gt;=</code> Greater or equal <code>&lt;=</code> Less or equal <pre><code>{% if price &gt; 100 %}...{% endif %}
{% if status != "cancelled" %}...{% endif %}
</code></pre>

Operator Description <code>and</code> Both conditions true <code>or</code> Either condition true <pre><code>{% if quantity &gt; 0 and inStock %}
    Available
{% endif %}

{% if isAdmin or isModerator %}
    Edit link
{% endif %}
</code></pre>

Filter Description <code>size</code> Number of items <code>first</code> First item <code>last</code> Last item <code>join</code> Join items with separator <code>sort</code> Sort items <code>reverse</code> Reverse order <code>uniq</code> Remove duplicates <code>map</code> Extract property from each item <code>where</code> Filter by property <code>compact</code> Remove nil values <pre><code>{{ items | size }}
&lt;!-- Result: 5 --&gt;

{{ items | map: "name" | join: ", " }}
&lt;!-- Result: Item 1, Item 2, Item 3 --&gt;

{{ items | where: "active", true | size }}
&lt;!-- Result: 3 (items where active is true) --&gt;

{{ items | sort: "price" | first | json }}
&lt;!-- Cheapest item --&gt;
</code></pre>
